    <div class="gs-vb-cta__shader" id="gs-vb-cta-shader"></div>
    <div class="gs-vb-cta__inner">
      <div class="gs-vb-cta__left">
        <h2 class="gs-vb-cta__title">Run the Benchmark Yourself</h2>
        <p class="gs-vb-cta__desc">
          VulnBench is fully open source and reproducible. Evaluate any LLM on the curated
          200-instance subset with a single command.
        </p>
        <div>
