    --judge claude-opus-4.6

  [████████████████████░░░░] 164/200

  Model      GPT-5.3 Codex
  Pass Rate  22.5%
  Score      0.468
  Passed     45/200
  Cost       $8.74
  Time       43.4s`}</pre>
